{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22012","headline":"寓意诗五首 三 · 白居易","name":"寓意诗五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促织不成章，提壶但闻声。\n嗟哉虫与鸟，无实有虚名。\n与君定交日，久要如弟兄。\n何以示诚信，白水指爲盟。\n云雨一爲别，飞沈两难幷。\n君爲得风鹏，我爲失水鲸。\n音信日已疎，恩分日已轻。\n穷通尚如此，何况死与生。\n乃知择交难，须有知人明。\n莫将山上松，结托水上萍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22012.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22012","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}